OL,3,GNEWSARunner, 80, does half marathon for
OL,4,Asepsis charity
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn 80-year-old runner has completed a
OL,7,Fhalf marathon in support of sepsis
OL,8,Fresearch, inspired by the recovery of
OL,9,FJersey student Lily McGarry.
OL,11,FJanine Fossey crossed the finish line
OL,12,Fof the Royal Parks Half Marathon in
OL,13,FLondon on 11 October which added
OL,14,Fanother medal to a running journey that
OL,15,Fhas already included seven marathons,
OL,16,Fand more half marathons and parkruns
OL,17,Fthan she was able to count.
OL,19,FFossey said the latest challenge came
OL,20,Fafter she began thinking about what she
OL,21,Fcould achieve in the year she turned
OL,22,F80.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
