OL,3,GNEWSARunner, 80, does half marathon for
OL,4,Asepsis charity
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Last year, my running had gone down. I
OL,7,Fwas getting slower and slower," she
OL,8,Fsaid. "I thought I would really love to
OL,9,Fdo a marathon or a half marathon next
OL,10,Fyear."
